<title>UK: Sterling jumps to 1996 highs vs mark in Europe.</title>
<headline>Sterling jumps to 1996 highs vs mark in Europe.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The pound strengthened further against the mark in Europe on Friday to trade at its highest levels this year, said currency dealers.</p>
<p>Sterling eclipsed the July peak of 2.3822 marks to trade at levels not seen since February 1995. By 1352 GMT, it was quoted at 2.3830/35 marks versus 2.3770/75 late in Europe on Thursday.</p>
